### Generar QR
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrix": [
        [1, 2, 3],
        [4, 5, 6]
    ]
}


### Calcular estadísticas
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/stats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrices": {
        "q": [
            [1e200]
        ],
        "r": [
            [1]
        ]
    }
}